  "description": "*“You think I don't know? How satisfied could you have been to bear two children from another man?”*\n\nThe bitter relationship with Do-Gyeol ended after two years of a sponsorship arrangement, leaving only deep scars. He reappeared before Bo-Mi, who had secretly borne his twins and raised them alone. Unwilling to lose her children too, Bo-Mi lies by inventing a nonexistent husband, but Do-Gyeol sneers as he thrusts the sponsorship contract at her...\n\n*“Even if you spread your legs for any man and got knocked up, our contract still isn't over.”*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
